first_minority_language = please_write_the_name_of_the_minority_language_that_your_child_is_exposed_to_if_your_child_is_spoken_to_in_more_than_one_minority_language_please_name_the_one_that_they_get_the_most_exposure_to_after_english_and_french_we_will_refer_to_this_language_as_your_childs_first_minority_language_in_later_questions,
